hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17","[AI-translation] Haddasana Sa'id bin Ya'qub At-Talqani, qala: Haddasana Ayyub bin Jabir, 'an Simak bin Harb, 'an Jabir bin Samurah, qala: Maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke dono kandhon ke darmiyan khatam (moj-e-nubuwwat) ko dekha, ek surkh ubharay hue gosht ki shakal mein, kabootar ke ande ke barabar."
"18","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu Mus'ab Al-Madini, qala: Haddasana Yusuf bin Al-Majishun, 'an abihi, 'an 'Asim bin 'Umar bin Qatadah, 'an jaddatihi Rumaythah, qalat: Maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko suna, aur main chahti ke jo khatam unke dono kandhon ke darmiyan tha, qurbat ki wajah se choom leti, (woh) Sa'd bin Mu'adh ke wafat ke din farmate hue: Arsh-e-Rahman unke liye hil gaya."
"19","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin 'Abdah Ad-Dabbi, wa 'Ali bin Hujr, wa ghayra wahid, qalu: Haddasana 'Isa bin Yunus, 'an 'Umar bin 'Abdullah mawla Ghufrah, qala: Haddathani Ibrahim bin Muhammad min walad 'Ali bin Abi Talib, qala: Ali jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ka wasf bayan karte to hadith taweel zikr karte, aur farmate: Unke dono kandhon ke darmiyan khatam-e-nubuwwat hai, aur woh nabiyo ka khatam hai."
"20","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bishshar, qala: Haddasana Abu 'Asim, qala: Haddasana 'Azrah bin Thabit, qala: Haddathani 'Ilba' bin Ahmar Al-Yashkuri, qala: Haddathani Abu Zayd 'Amr bin Akhtab Al-Ansari, qala: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne mujhse farmaya: Aye Abu Zayd! Mere paas aao aur meri peeth par haath phero. To maine unki peeth par haath phera to meri ungliyan khatam par padhi. Maine poocha: Khatam kya hai? Farmaya: Jama hui tamam baal."
"21","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu 'Ammar Al-Husayn bin Hurayth Al-Khuza'i, qala: Haddasana 'Ali bin Husayn bin Waqid, Haddathani abi, qala: Haddathani 'Abdullah bin Buraydah, qala: Maine apne Abu Buraydah ko farmate hue suna: Salman Al-Farisi Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas jab Madina tashrif laye to ek khwan le kar aaye jis par khajoor ke majeen (rutab) the, to use Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke samne rakh diya. Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aye Salman! Yeh kya hai? Arz kiya: Aap aur aapke ashab ke liye sadqah hai. Farmaya: Isay utha lo, beshak hum sadqah nahi khate. Qala: To unhonen utha liya. Phir agle din waisi hi cheez le kar aaye aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke samne rakh di. Farmaya: Aye Salman! Yeh kya hai? Arz kiya: Aapke liye tohfa hai. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne apne ashab se farmaya: Bichhao. Phir unhone Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki peeth par khatam (moj-e-nubuwwat) ko dekha aur imaan laye. Aur woh Yahudon ka ghulam tha, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne itne-itne dirham mein khareed liya, is shart par ke woh unke liye khajoor ke darht lagaye aur Salman un mein kaam kare yahan tak ke khajoor khane layak ho jaye. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne darht lagaye siwaye ek darht ke jise 'Umar ne lagaya tha. To us saal saare darhton ko phal a gaya aur woh ek darht phal nahi layi. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Is darht ki kya baat hai? 'Umar ne kaha: Aye Rasoolullah! Main ne isay lagaya tha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne isay ukhaar kar wapas lagaya aur us saal isay phal a gaya."
"22","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bishshar, qala: Haddasana Bishr bin Al-Waddah, qala: Haddasana Abu 'Aqil Ad-Dawraqi, 'an Abu Nadrah Al-'Awqi, qala: Maine Abu Sa'id Al-Khudri se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke khatam ke baare mein poocha, yani khatam-e-nubuwwat ke baare mein. To unhone kaha: Unki peeth par ek ubhari hui gosht ki boti thi."
"23","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin Al-Miqdam Abu Al-Ash'ath Al-'Ijli Al-Basri, qala: Akhbarana Hammad bin Zayd, 'an 'Asim Al-Ahwal, 'an 'Abdullah bin Sarjis, qala: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas aaya jab aap apke ashab mein se kuch logon ke saath the. To main unke peechhe se aise ghooma. To unhe meri niyat maaloom ho gayi, to unhone apni peeth se chadar hatayi, to maine unke kandhon par khatam ki jagah dekhi, ek girah (jama) jaisa, jis ke gird til ke barabar dagh (khilan) the, goya ke woh masay hon. Phir main palat kar unke samne aa gaya aur kaha: Aye Rasoolullah! Allah aapko maaf kare. Aapne farmaya: Aapko bhi. Logon ne kaha: Kya Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne aapke liye darguzar ki dua farmayi? Unhone farmaya: Haan, aur tumhare liye bhi. Phir aapne yeh ayat parhi: {Wa-staghfir li-dhanbika wa lil-mu'minina wal-mu'minat} (Aur apne gunah aur momin mard aur momin aurton ke liye darguzar ki dua farma)."
"24","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Ali bin Hujr, qala: Akhbarana Isma'il bin Ibrahim, 'an Humayd, 'an Anas bin Malik, qala: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke baal unke dono kaano ke nisf tak the."
